ors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Children","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Comedy","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"U","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Seasonal","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"1992","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"On Christmas Eve, a young boy embarks on a magical adventure to the North Pole on the Polar Express, while learning about friendship, bravery, and the spirit of Christmas.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/ad43d4b0-1840-430e-8403-0875f6a04989.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Christmas 2026: The Polar Express + Pyjama Party","instanceDates":"20 December-20 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/ad43d4b0-1840-430e-8403-0875f6a04989-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"271202AJLGGSKRPDJTJDCNTLPMVJVRNVS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-20T15:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-20T15:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-20T15:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-20T15:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"Contains mild threat","attribute_Director":"Robert Zemeckis","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"455044","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Animation","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Fantasy","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"U","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Seasonal","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2004","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Celebrating its spectacular 10th anniversary, Cirque Enchantment returns with a UK theatre tour for early 2027,  a spellbinding fusion of circus, music, mystery, and jaw-dropping live performance. Step into a glittering frozen world where secrets hide beneath the sparkle and a battle between good and evil unfolds.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/8194bab4-461c-4eaa-affa-3e000e1bee7f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Cirque Enchantment","instanceDates":"12 March-12 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/8194bab4-461c-4eaa-affa-3e000e1bee7f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"232401ATGLQSRNMDBKBKRHQVCCQDCJHNL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-12T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-12T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-12T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-12T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"5+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Family","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"A Sparkling Musical Entertainment. Written and Performed by Nicola Keen & Malcolm McKee. Nicola Keen's celebrated portrayal of the incomparable Joyce Grenfell sparkles in this irresistible musical celebration of one of Britain's most beloved entertainers.\r\nStep back into the wit, warmth and elegance of 1940s and 1950s Britain as Joyce's unforgettable comedy songs and razor-sharp monologues are brought gloriously to life. Featuring favourites including 'Stately as a Galleon', 'School Nativity Play', and many more, the evening is complemented by classic comic gems from Flanders & Swann and Noël Coward.\r\nFilled with laughter, nostalgia and timeless charm, Cocktails with Joyce Grenfell is a smashing evening of British humour that celebrates the wit, grace and enduring legacy of a true national treasure. Raise a glass and join us for an unforgettable encounter with one of the country's finest comediennes. George, don't do that!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/1c94a2c1-17f3-4338-8f32-3c6148660ba9.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Cocktails with Joyce Grenfell","instanceDates":"29 May-29 May","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/1c94a2c1-17f3-4338-8f32-3c6148660ba9-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"275201AGPPGVGBPNHNCKPBGSJLBDNQCTK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-29T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-29T18:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-29T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-29T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Age guidance: 10+","attribut