eetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Comedian and Folk Singer. Winner Edinburgh’s Spirit of the Fringe 2024, Best Variety Show Leicester Comedy Festival 2024, Nominee Best Show Edinburgh Fringe 2024. As heard on BBC Radio 4’s “The Now Show” and seen on “Rosie Jones’s Disability Comedy Extravaganza”. From three-time BBC Radio 2 Folk Award winning band The Young'uns.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a8bb02a1-415f-45d2-b8c5-65deddbfd6ed.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"David Eagle: Funny Folk","instanceDates":"3 February-3 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a8bb02a1-415f-45d2-b8c5-65deddbfd6ed-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"244601ARVVBGHBNLKTJRKTJSRKCSDBNDT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-03T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-03T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-03T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-03T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Santa is determined to deliver the most fantastic Christmas present to Sarah, but he doesn't get it right straight away! With the help of his cheeky Elf, he finally settles on something ‘perfect,’ just in time for Christmas Eve. From the author of the well-loved children's book Dear Zoo, Rod Campbell, comes Dear Santa and it's LIVE! This show is an ideal introduction to theatre for those aged two and over.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0598b8de-622e-445b-b63d-08fd46e361ed.jpg\" /><span><br/></span>Santa is determined to deliver the most fantastic Christmas present to Sarah, but he doesn't get it right straight away! With the help of his cheeky Elf, he finally settles on something ‘perfect,’ just in time for Christmas Eve.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>From the author of the well-loved children's book Dear Zoo, Rod Campbell, comes Dear Santa—and it's LIVE! This show is an ideal introduction to theatre for those aged two and over.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Christmas cheer continues with the opportunity to meet Santa in his grotto after the show, where every child will receive an extra special gift!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sure to be one Christmas present children and parents alike will never forget, Dear Santa Live is the perfect family show to enjoy this festive season.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><table class=\" BorderOn\">\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Age Recommendation</span> </td><td align=\"left\">Under 7's<span><br/></span></td>\r\n\t\t</tr><tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Running Time</span> </td><td align=\"left\">55 minutes approx.<span><br/></span></td>\r\n\t\t</tr><tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><span class=\"BoldText\">School bookings</span> </td><td align=\"left\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:Rebecca.Pegg@beamhertford.co.uk\">contact us</a><span><br/></span></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n</div>","duration":55,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0598b8de-622e-445b-b63d-08fd46e361ed.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Dear Santa","instanceDates":"18 December-21 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0598b8de-622e-445b-b63d-08fd46e361ed-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":"dearsanta","id":"103401ARHBPTVKLPJHTPMHBHTKJHTPTGP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-18T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-18T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-21T11:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-21T11:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Ages 2-7","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Family","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Christmas","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"An awkward teen and her Type-A mother learn her peculiarities might be magical powers, transforming their lives and revealing a hidden magical realm.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":109,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/36b2d488-fedd-462c-be2c-2c6aebb5bf72.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Disney’s Hexed","instanceDates":"27 November-3 December","thumbnailUrl":