d dance from the 60’s through to the noughties as the talented students perform on Beams wonderful main stage. EPA is Hertford’s home grown stage school for Children aged 6-16yrs nurturing musical theatre talent.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/1780cc0c-c26e-4183-ab02-e3e284a1ee9f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Elite Performers Academy Presents: Battle of the Decades ","instanceDates":"22 November-22 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/1780cc0c-c26e-4183-ab02-e3e284a1ee9f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"252201ABDBLDPPHJNLTGMLCCTMNKGGMGL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-22T15:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-22T15:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-22T15:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-22T15:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Community Vibe – Local connection, social events.","attribute_FinanceFilter":"Hire","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Local Talent","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Dance","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"2027 marks 50 years since the passing of the King of Rock ’n’ Roll. 2024 Ultimate Elvis Tribute Artist World Champion Emilio Santoro celebrates the legacy of Elvis Presley in a spectacular live tribute show.  \r\n\r\nBacked by his authentic 1950s band, The Creoles, Emilio brings Elvis’ early career to life, from the iconic Sun Records recordings and classic movie years to the legendary ’68 Comeback Special.  \r\n\r\nAudiences can expect timeless hits including Jailhouse Rock, Hound Dog, Blue Suede Shoes, Devil in Disguise, Suspicious Minds, plus many more. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/d8a867d2-0794-4247-b064-a6cd4a7b524f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Emilio Santoro as Elvis: 50th Anniversary","instanceDates":"25 February-25 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/d8a867d2-0794-4247-b064-a6cd4a7b524f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"275802AGGKDJKPLRTCNPPCTNSDTKDKRKJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-25T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-25T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-25T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-25T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"This 2026 documentary follows elite ski mountaineers Jim Morrison and Hilaree Nelson as they fall in love chasing their shared dream of climbing the notoriously dangerous direct North Face of Mount Everest and skiing down the hazardous Hornbein Couloir.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":115,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/d9270a6c-fd3b-4eed-b9ad-59e98b1763fc.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Everest: The Other Side","instanceDates":"4 December-10 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/d9270a6c-fd3b-4eed-b9ad-59e98b1763fc-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"277801ANGCPRHSJVQJKCDPLJTQRHKTMMG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-04T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-04T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-10T17:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-10T17:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"This film contains upsetting scenes, moderate threat, infrequent strong language","attribute_Director":"Jimmy Chin and Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"521436","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Documentary","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Adventure","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"12A","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Immerse yourself in iconic masterpieces and discover\r\nthe incredible story of passion and rebellion in this\r\nexciting documentary on the man who named the\r\nworld’s fav