iv id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a0500be7-cf95-4567-aed9-d285d8015f8f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Girl Pop Live","instanceDates":"16 January-16 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a0500be7-cf95-4567-aed9-d285d8015f8f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"194401ADCGMNHNRPKQQPQKCPKSNQHSTQR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-16T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-16T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-16T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-16T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Dance","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Haileybury brings the Tony Award-winning sensation *Hadestown: Teen Edition* to the BEAM Theatre stage. Anaïs Mitchell’s haunting, jazz-infused musical reimagines the ancient Greek myths of Orpheus and Eurydice alongside King Hades and Persephone. Set in a post-apocalyptic, industrial underworld, this gripping tale explores love, sacrifice, and hope against impossible odds. Featuring a talent-packed youth cast, dynamic choreography, and unforgettable folk-blues melodies, this exhilarating production promises an enchanting theatrical experience that invites audiences to see 'how the world could be.'","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Haileybury Presents: Hadestown: Teen Edition","instanceDates":"4 February-6 February","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"278201ALSPSKDGQGKMMPKVMMKBMSCPJVS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-04T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-04T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-06T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-06T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Community Vibe – Local connection, social events.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Local Talent","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Join presenter Sam Chaplin and the Hertford Symphony Orchestra for an exciting musical adventure packed with familiar favourites and thrilling tunes! From the fast and furious Flight of the Bumblebee to the wild west sounds of Copland’s Rodeo, the spectacular William Tell Overture and music from Jurassic Park and Pirates of the Caribbean, there’s something to capture everyone’s imagination. With audience participation and the chance for children (and orchestra members!) to come in fancy dress, this is a concert to get everyone involved. Lasting approximately 55 minutes, it’s the perfect introduction to the excitement of a live orchestra.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":60,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/119da0a2-21a3-4806-86d2-ddd74d9398b9.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Hertford Symphony Orchestra: Family","instanceDates":"31 January-31 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/119da0a2-21a3-4806-86d2-ddd74d9398b9-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"282401ACMMJJVMCSDTMRDRDQLDGPTKLRS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-31T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-31T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-31T15:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-31T15:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Local Talent","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Hidden Jazz Club is not your average night out. Dreamed up and run by musicians, this underground series drops you straight into the beating heart of London’s world-class jazz scene — no velvet ropes, no awkward small talk, just seriously good music and a night to remember.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/124cdd99-a83d-4501-9653-e87ec2d29aa8.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Dreamed up and run by musicians, this underground series drops you straight into the beating heart of London’s world-class jazz scene right here in Hertford. No velvet ropes, no awkward small talk, just seriously good music and a night to remember.<span><br/></span>​<span><br/></span>Hidden Jazz Club has sold out shows from Paris to Tokyo and featured everyone from Grammy winners to future legends. If you're after something real — something electric — this is your invitation.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.hiddenjazzclub.com/hertford?_gl=1*1tapkmc*_up*MQ..*_ga*ODE2OTkzMDg5LjE3NTU4NTYxMjY.*_ga_X2ZYB8S6NK*czE3NTU4NTYxMjYkbzEkZzAkdDE3NTU4NTYxMjYkajYwJGwwJGgw\">Click here for more information!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/124cdd99-a83d-4501-9653-e87ec2d29aa8.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Hidden Jazz Club","instanceDates":"6 November-10 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/124cdd99-a83d-4501-9653-e87ec2d29aa8-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":"HJC25","id":"129601AJTVSHQVBBSVVGKVNQGGPHNMBSC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-06T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-06T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-10T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-10T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Roll Up! Roll Up! The risqué, raunchy & ridiculous people of Hundred Watt Club make their Havant debut with a glittering and glorious evening of burlesque, vaudeville & comedy!\r\nStep into a world of old time glamour and new time wit, with a seductive, sizzling and sometimes very silly cast hand selected by Hundred Watt Club’s Lena Love, this show is a no-holds barred, full throttle journey into the wonderful world of showgirls, spectacles & songbirds.\r\nHundred Watt Club is proud to be one of the longest running burlesque revues in the UK…Expect the unexpected, but gear up for a good old fashioned, very grown up evening of variety entertainment. Forget your troubles and come to the cabaret!\r\nDazzling line-up TBA! \r\n\r\nStrong language, adult themes, partial nudity, loud noises. Strictly 18+ only.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/77f295bf-bbc5-40d5-8b7d-b6f2b21ed7c8.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Hundred Watt Club – An evening of Burlesque & Cabaret","instanceDates":"26 February-26 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/77f295bf-bbc5-40d5-8b7d-b6f2b21ed7c8-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"264202ABLNBHRRMBNVTKTNBJTVRHTNSKR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-26T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-26T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-26T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-26T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Strong language, adult themes, partial nudity, loud noises. Over 18s only.","attribute_ContentWarning":"Strong language, adult themes, partial nudity, loud noises. Over 18s only.","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Fear and Loathing meets South Park in a screwball monologue that's part romance, part buddy comedy, part body horror. \r\nTwo miles north of Hell, a nameless deadbeat narrator spots Satan buying soy milk at the 7-Eleven. Satan's a washed-up has-been, who’s totally lost his edge. That is until he falls in love with our narrator and the two embark on a debauched misadventure, by turns slapstick, violent, whimsical, dreamlike and tender.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":66,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/85134e6f-6cbd-4430-856f-33a28b10e7f5.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"I Saw Satan at the 7-Eleven","instanceDates":"15 April-15 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/85134e6f-6cbd-4430-856f-33a28b10e7f5-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"278801ARMMVDSHSSGHKNLKDVBDSKVDDJP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-15T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-15T18:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-15T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-15T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Ages 16+ ","attribute_ContentWarning":"Ages 16+ adult content and strong language","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Something Different – Fresh, original, or unexpected experience (ie new writing).","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Told through never-before-seen footage from Buckley’s archives and intimate accounts from his\r\nmother Mary Guibert, former partners Rebecca Moore and Joan Wasser, Jeff’s former\r\nbandmates, including Michael Tighe and Parker Kindred, and luminaries like Ben Harper and\r\nAimee Mann, IT’S NEVER OVER, JEFF BUCKLEY illuminates one of modern music’s most\r\ninfluential and enigmatic figures.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":106,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/e7eace21-c9fa-45bb-bc84-431004c87efe.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"It's Never Over, Jeff Buckley","instanceDates":"11 December-11 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/e7eace21-c9fa-45bb-bc84-431004c87efe-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"258001AGMVJBGNBHRVHNCSNJCGVTSNQKH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-11T20:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-11T20:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-11T20:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-11T20:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Director":"Amy Berg","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"471636","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Documentary","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Music","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/1faad40a-9076-4ab4-88e6-9cb3d065ec3b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Jack & The Beanstalk - Panto 2026","instanceDates":"9 December-3 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/1faad40a-9076-4ab4-88e6-9cb3d065ec3b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"171801ACVBMLPMGCDNCSVNVLSMKTBPNBB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-09T10:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-09T10:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-03T15:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-03T15:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Accessible":"Yes","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Suitable for all ages","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_FinanceFilter":"Self Produced","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_StageGenre":"Christmas","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Who doesn’t like jokes? If your answer to that question is “Me!” then steer clear of this show. Celebrating 40 years in standup, Jack Dee takes us on a memoir of his favourite old jokes.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/c6fef78f-37e5-47bd-99b6-29b3ab4b3054.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Jack Dee: Jack’s Joke Show","instanceDates":"22 April-22 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/c6fef78f-37e5-47bd-99b6-29b3ab4b3054-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"253601ANLKNBKSHBKMVJDCTRLTJRSMDJT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-22T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-22T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-22T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-22T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"STRICTLY 14+","attribute_ContentWarning":"Likely to be swearing and adult content","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Ten years ago, James’ best friend Tom was diagnosed with heart cancer and given three months to live. His last wish was to have a full Viking burial. So James gave him one. \r\n\r\nTeam Viking tells the remarkable, hilarious and heart-lifting story of how James actually managed to give his best mate the send-off he wanted. Blending storytelling, music, comedy and even a genuine Viking helmet, it’s a comic ode to death, friendship and the beautiful absurdity of life. \r\n\r\nThe show premiered in a tiny meeting room at the 2016 Edinburgh Fringe and became a breakthrough hit: critically acclaimed, completely sold out, and the beginning of James’ career as a contemporary storyteller. Since then it has been performed hundreds of times across the UK and internationally. \r\n\r\nNow, ten years on, this modern classic returns for a special anniversary edition - as funny, raw and joyous as ever. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":70,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/41399860-e908-40a2-a38b-5a94e5a1f33a.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"James Rowland: Team Viking","instanceDates":"25 February-25 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/41399860-e908-40a2-a38b-5a94e5a1f33a-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"260201AVGTPVCGJSRMNPGDDVLVVTHHGTM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-25T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-25T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-25T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-25T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"14+ Contains adult themes and occasional adult language","attribute_ContentWarning":"14+ Contains adult themes and occasional adult language","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Following on from his smash hit debut tour and comedy special ‘Smart Casual’, Jeff Innocent returns with an all new hour of standup. At the ripe age of 71, and after decades of resistance, Jeff has finally decided to embrace his twilight years with a calm and accepting mindset. That’s the plan anyway…","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/65ecf508-5da2-4478-9113-b8f59003fdf0.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Jeff Innocent: Leaning In","instanceDates":"8 April-8 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/65ecf508-5da2-4478-9113-b8f59003fdf0-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"256201ASKKTJMTPPDHMPSRSRNNGDLVJBR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-08T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-08T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-08T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-08T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"16+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"JINGLE BALLS - The Queens of Red and Green bring you a Christmas party like you’ve\r\nnever seen!\r\nStars of\r\nRu Paul’s Drag Race UK\r\n&\r\nDragged to the Musicals\r\nDivina De\r\nCampo\r\nand\r\nVeronica Green\r\nunite in this “Camp As Christmas” homage to the most\r\nwonderful time of the year, in\r\nevery\r\nstyle. Supported by their very own chorus line of\r\nstrapping dancers, this is a Christmas show like no other!\r\nDress up to the MAX and come and join the Queens and their amazing cast to kick off the\r\nfestive season!\r\nIncredible vocals, hilarious entertainment, plus a troupe of Santa’s to lead the way... But\r\nhopefully, no Jingle Balls on display!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b2356993-9038-4806-b833-d51d3cfd257c.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Jingle Balls: Divina De Campo & Veronica Green","instanceDates":"28 November-28 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b2356993-9038-4806-b833-d51d3cfd257c-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"269601APDMKCPDNGQRVNPDTDPQSKDHRQS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-11-28T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-11-28T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-11-28T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-11-28T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"11+ (mild language and innuendo)","attribute_Cont