ribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Stand-up comedian, aspiring house-husband and the leggiest blonde in Manchester, Josh Jones is back on Tour with more gut-punchingly hilarious tales, and this time he's tackling the big subjects - Life, Death and Boobs. \r\n\r\nSoon to appear on the next series of Last One Laughing on Prime Video. A TV regular, Josh has also made stand-out appearances on 8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown, The Jonathan Ross Show, Would I Lie To You and much much more. \r\n\r\n'Supremely gifted comic who can turn the slightest of events into a crowd-pleasing routine' **** Beyond The Joke \r\n\r\n“Cheeky, charming and full of charisma... no filter and no time for filler” **** I Talk Telly\r\n\r\n'this Mancunian comic is in his prime' **** The List","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":115,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b3684f43-f664-4d72-a659-fc292012e1db.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Josh Jones: Confessions of a Leggy Blonde","instanceDates":"21 October-21 October","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b3684f43-f664-4d72-a659-fc292012e1db-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"278401ATSTMRNLKVBNRKPLJJLSRKMQCQC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-10-21T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-10-21T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-10-21T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-10-21T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"STRICTLY 16+","attribute_ContentWarning":"STRICTLY 16+ Likely to be swearing and adult content","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"After 2 sell out tours, Josh Pugh is back performing stand up comedy to the best of his ability for an hour and a bit. Josh is known for his appearances on the small screen (TV) Live at the Apollo, Big Fat Quiz of Everything, Mock the Week, Would I Lie to You, The Last Leg as well his appearances on even smaller screens (your phone) with his weekly viral videos. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/27513346-4488-4bc1-9713-6113de776d91.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Josh Pugh: Ha Ha Yeah Sound","instanceDates":"22 January-22 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/27513346-4488-4bc1-9713-6113de776d91-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"279201ARKNVLRKTKDVNQKJCGLMNPGHJNM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-22T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-22T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-22T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-22T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"14+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Coming off the back of his sold out 'Don’t Listen To Me' UK tour, Kane brings you his brand-new show. One hour of purely unscripted, unplanned comedy; all based around audience participation.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/82719f28-8d72-4ead-870a-8048f319658f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Kane Brown: Crowd Work King","instanceDates":"10 March-10 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/82719f28-8d72-4ead-870a-8048f319658f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"253801ABLCMBKLMSRBMJSLTQBLMNQVSKT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-10T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-10T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-10T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-10T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"``16+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"6:30pm","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"Yes","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Bring old friends and make new friends at the best Christmas party in town as Kate Garner leads the singalong from Roll Out The Barrel to your favourite Christmas Carol.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/2f3c762c-f458-4f18-a1fa-9689f1a6e948.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Bring old friends and make new friends at the best Christmas party in town as Kate Garner leads the singalong from Roll Out The Barrel to your favourite Christmas Carol.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>As the daughter of Chas from ‘Chas & Dave’, London girl Kate grew up singing with her family around the piano and is now bringing the party to the stage for the ultimate festive knees up. The show features all the Christmas classics from Jingle Bells to Winter Wonderland, plus timeless singalong tunes from great British musicals such as Oliver and Mary Poppins.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>And, as an extra special Christmas treat, Kate will be joined for a song or two by her godfather and her dad’s best pal Dave Peacock from ‘Chas & Dave’.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Having fronted her own TV series ‘The Stories Behind The Songs’ and played sold out shows in London, Los Angeles and San Francisco, Kate is delighted to be spending Christmas back in Hertfordshire where she spent much of her childhood.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>So, tell your friends, family, neighbours and workmates to come along and celebrate Christmas in good voice and great company at BEAM, Hertford, Friday December 19th 2025.<span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/2f3c762c-f458-4f18-a1fa-9689f1a6e948.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Kate Garner’s Christmas Party At The Piano","instanceDates":"18 December-18 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/2f3c762c-f458-4f18-a1fa-9689f1a6e948-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"130601APHPQJHJPRKCMSLRCJTVSRDKMKQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-18T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-18T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-18T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-18T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"14+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_FinanceFilter":"Hire","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"KATZEYE – The Tribute Experience is a spectacular high energy live production celebrating one of the world’s fastest rising global pop groups. With KATZEYE’s popularity exploding worldwide, a sold out world tour and iconic headline Coachella slot, demand for all things KATZEYE has never been bigger.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/c9423539-7fc8-4195-8650-082151fa2f9b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Katzeye","instanceDates":"4 June-4 June","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/c9423539-7fc8-4195-8650-082151fa2f9b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"269401AMHRPSKRVJGHRVNCVDCKKLDPTJQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-04T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-04T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-04T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-04T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Dance","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Censored for more than half a century, Ken Russell’s visionary masterpiece returns to the big screen fully restored in 4K and cut to Russell’s direction — the first publicly released version of the film as intended by the filmmaker.\r\n\r\nUnveiled at the 79th Cannes Film Festival, the definitive version arrives 55 years after the film’s original release. Starring Oliver Reed and Vanessa Redgrave, Ken Russell’s The Devils remains a landmark exploration of religious persecution, hysteria and institutional corruption.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":115,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/4a3c004d-fa3c-4bd9-bf18-698ed8b9e744.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ken Russell's The Devils (4k Restoration)","instanceDates":"4 December-4 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/4a3c004d-fa3c-4bd9-bf18-698ed8b9e744-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"281601AVMGGHHBQLKGGCCBDHVMHLHGNJB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-04T20:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-04T20:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-04T20:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-04T20:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"Contains suicide and self harm, strong violence and sexualised nudity","attribute_Director":"Ken Russell","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"519603","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Edge of Your Seat – Thrilling, intense, suspenseful.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Drama","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_Rating":"18","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"A live concert celebrating the biggest K-Pop and Pop anthems in one family-friendly show! Starring the K-Pop Icons sensational live vocalists, this high-energy production is perfect for children, families and pop lovers of all ages! You’re invited to sing your heart out, learn the moves and dance along! From start to finish, the audience is at the heart of the action, making every performance an exciting, interactive party.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a83a57d0-7deb-4f0b-ae3a-5bb3ab244a4c.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"K-Pop Party","instanceDates":"30 March-30 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a83a57d0-7deb-4f0b-ae3a-5bb3ab244a4c-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"246201ALRPGQVDRCSCCBLPBLRJGKCQJRM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-30T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-30T17:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-30T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-30T17:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Family","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Explores what it means to be gay throughout different eras, focusing on \"three existences\" that are connected through themes of sexuality, desire, pain, and inheritance. Musical drama following the lives of three men who are connected across generations by shared legacies.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":159,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/99b51e26-e51e-4723-a487-5dd8047c9e30.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"La Bola Negra","instanceDates":"13 November-19 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/99b51e26-e51e-4723-a487-5dd8047c9e30-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"274001APPTJPJLJCBTSDGHNDCCBVLQCTD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-13T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-13T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-19T17:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-19T17:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"Contains strong language, injury detail, violence, sex, nudity","attribute_Director":"Javier Calvo & Javier Ambrossi","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"493162","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Drama","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Romantic","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Fresh from dazzling millions on Strictly Come Dancing, La Voix is back – bigger, bolder and more fabulous than ever. Having waltzed her way into the nation’s heart, she’s gone on to conquer the UK, becoming quite possibly the most recognisable redhead in Britain.\r\nExpect an evening of sensational live vocals, outrageous comedy, razor-sharp wit and more glamour than should be allowed. Whether she’s  belting out showstoppers, sharing scandalous stories or leaving audiences crying with laughter, La Voix delivers a night of world-class entertainment that’s unpredictable and unforgettable.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/270ae048-4