available":true,"attribute_StageGenre":"Family","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<h1>Mama G's Baby Panto - Adult Tickets</h1> <span><br/></span><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/761c87d3-cc27-4676-80f9-9e4f69d2d6e7.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>When purchasing tickets, you will first be asked to select the number of children under 18 months attending. On the following page, you will then be asked to select the number of accompanying adults. This is because there is a limit on the number of under-18-month-olds we can accommodate at each performance.\r\n</div>","duration":40,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/761c87d3-cc27-4676-80f9-9e4f69d2d6e7.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mama G's Baby Panto - Adult Tickets","instanceDates":"21 December-23 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/761c87d3-cc27-4676-80f9-9e4f69d2d6e7-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"267201ASTQMDKVJHVPBBVHJDGVDVBRMGH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-21T11:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-21T11:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-23T11:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-23T11:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"parents / carers","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_StageGenre":"Family","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Join us for a Thriller of an evening, as we celebrate the legendary music of the KING OF POP.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a240ecd9-1ead-4054-b8d6-99e5830c2772.jpg\" /><span><br/></span>Join us for a Thriller of an evening, as we celebrate the legendary music of the King of Pop.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This is “Man in the Mirror”—the brand-new must-see, electrifying tribute concert to Michael Jackson.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Starring CJ, one of the world’s greatest Michael Jackson Tribute Artists, and supported by a talented cast of performers and musicians who capture the essence of Michael Jackson’s unique style and charisma like no other, in this scintillating production that will keep you on the edge of your seats.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring all his greatest hits you know and love, including \"Thriller,\" \"Billie Jean,\" \"Beat It,\" \"Smooth Criminal,\" and, of course, \"Man in the Mirror.\"<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Complete with dazzling choreography, stunning visual effects, a spectacular light show, and authentic costumes. This is the show that pays tribute to Jackson’s musical legacy.<span><br/></span>So, whether you’re a lifelong fan or experiencing the magic of Michael Jackson for the first time, get ready as we take you back in time, for a night like no other.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a240ecd9-1ead-4054-b8d6-99e5830c2772.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Man In The Mirror – A Tribute To Michael Jackson","instanceDates":"9 January-9 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a240ecd9-1ead-4054-b8d6-99e5830c2772-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"98201APGBTHJSQKRVSCNKTBQBGVMNPQHT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-09T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-09T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-09T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-09T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Under 14’s must be accompanied by a parent or guardian.","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"In his hit BBC Radio 4 show ‘Mark Steel’s In Town’, Mark tries to explain simply and plainly how each town works. In this brand-new show he’ll do the same, but for the state of the world. He’ll be calmly and gently yelling in exasperation at the crazy fruitbat bonkers eruptions of infuriating insanity that blasts in every direction at us all, so that at the end of the show it all makes sense and we can relax in a dreamy sense of well-being and never be bothered by anything ever again.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":160,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/637d9b34-5350-4962-9be3-bf8201ee5aba.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mark Steel: What The F*** Is Going On?","instanceDates":"30 April-30 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/637d9b34-5350-4962-9be3-bf8201ee5aba-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"278601ABBJBKGQRDLHCCRMRLNMPBGBPTT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-30T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-30T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-30T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-30T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"STRICTLY 14+","attribute_ContentWarning":"STRICTLY 14+ Likely to be swearing and adult content","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"This show is a dream come true for fans of the musicals – a sing-along celebration of all your favourite hits from stage and screen, led by an amazing live band. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://sy