ry about one woman who loses everything. Remembering the tastes and aromas of her mother’s kitchen with live cooking on stage, she recreates the dishes of her childhood and homeland, building a new life and community around food. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":65,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/6b72bfbd-bbc6-4441-ae2e-2813cfb26aa4.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"My English Persian Kitchen","instanceDates":"4 March-4 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/6b72bfbd-bbc6-4441-ae2e-2813cfb26aa4-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"259801AGVGTJVVHMJPHGQGNGTDGJCMNLT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-04T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-04T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-04T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-04T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"14+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"After jabbering on about it every week on her hit podcast Life With Nat, ultimate hun Natalie Cassidy is stepping into the world of live podcasting with a very special live tour. The show will be filled with chat and laughter, as well as a possible guest appearance from some of your favourite family members or celebrity friends. Plus, the shows will feature YOU, the fans, who have made the podcast what it is.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/56e1fc38-7e30-4f8f-95dd-26a9537c9a7a.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Natalie Cassidy: Live with Nat","instanceDates":"30 May-30 May","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/56e1fc38-7e30-4f8f-95dd-26a9537c9a7a-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"195001ABNTHCSKTCMTBLCHGBNBVLMKCGJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-30T14:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-30T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-30T14:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-30T13:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"STRICTLY 14+ Likely to be swearing and adult content","attribute_ContentWarning":"Likely to be swearing and adult content","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Celebrity Talk","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Get ready Hertford… Nicky Trix and his very cheeky sidekick Nambu the Elephant are bringing Easter to life in a brilliantly bonkers family spectacular!\r\n\r\nWinner of the National Entertainment Award and Children’s Entertainer of the Year, Nicky Trix brings jaw dropping magic, laugh out loud comedy, crazy games, competitions and audience participation, with Nambu causing plenty of mischief along the way!\r\n\r\nExpect big laughs, big surprises and a whole lot of Easter chaos.\r\n\r\nHertford, are you ready to join the EGG-STRAVAGANZA?","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Nicky Trix Easter Egg-Stravaganza","instanceDates":"27 March-27 March","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"282601ANNKKKGDHKGSSBBJJNLDKGJKGQR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-27T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-27T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-27T13:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-27T13:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Nik Kershaw is ready to look back with an intimate evening to coincide with the release of his new book. Expect songs, stories, and silliness from one of the nation’s most-loved performers.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/7c906efa-3f6b-4bae-905e-cebaa44214f2.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Nik Kershaw","instanceDates":"6 March-6 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/7c906efa-3f6b-4bae-905e-cebaa44214f2-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"199201AQKKTKLQJCJNCHHMGTMPLQNPMSQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-06T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-06T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-06T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-06T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Date Night – Ideal for couples looking for a special evening.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"a photograph, autograph and goody bag","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"6pm","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"Yes","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Celebrity Talk","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"1930s New York, at the height of the Depression. Joe Bonaparte is a gifted young violinist with a future in music, until a chance at fame and fortune lures him into the brutal world of professional boxing. He must confront what he’s willing to sacrifice, who he’s willing to become and how to find his place in a world that demands he choose a side. \r\n\r\nBrought to life with a live string quartet and filmed live from the Almeida Theatre. Olivier Award-winner Sam Yates (Vanya) directs this propulsive drama exploring ambition, identity, and the high price of success.  ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/205bf566-95b6-4335-9f5b-7c227c8a0fd6.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"NT Live: Golden Boy","instanceDates":"5 November-27 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/205bf566-95b6-4335-9f5b-7c227c8a0fd6-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"246001AGMCSNPGLTNMQKSGHTPMLRMLJPT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-05T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-05T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-27T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-27T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Accessible":"Caption Available","attribute_ContentWarning":"This production may include flashing lights, which may impact customers with photosensitive epilepsy.","attribute_Director":"Sam Yates","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"493623","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Theatre","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Music","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"TBC","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Emmy and Tony winner Christine Baranski makes her West End debut alongside Academy\r\nAward-nominated stage and screen legend Richard E. Grant in Noël Coward’s irresistible\r\ncomedy.\r\nJudith Bliss retired from her life-on-stage and she misses the applause. Idling away at their\r\ncountry home, the rest of the family are too self-involved to be a good audience. So, Judith\r\ninvites a young fan as her guest for the weekend. But unbeknownst to her, each of the\r\nBlisses has a guest of their own arriving at the very same time.\r\nFilmed live from the West End, Emily Burns directs this stinging new production.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":160,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b1e64b30-705a-42a3-9753-36a98a477ba7.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"NT Live: Hay Fever","instanceDates":"14 January-17 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b1e64b30-705a-42a3-9753-36a98a477ba7-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"267401APVJCKGHJKLQKVTBJBNGNQSCMPD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-14T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-14T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-17T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-17T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Director":"Emily Burns","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"513375","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"TBC","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Award-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Molière’s classic dark comedy. Filmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp’s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":150,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/20344b1e-1f03-47f7-94fb-181f3fec52d1.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"NT Live: The Misanthrope","instanceDates":"22 September-9 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/20344b1e-1f03-47f7-94fb-181f3fec52d1-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"228401AKCHSCQSGKMVGGJVHRBMSHTLGCD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-09-22T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-09-22T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-09T17:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-09T17:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Accessible":"Caption Available","attribute_ContentWarning":"This screen may contain some strong language and adult themes","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"513373","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Theatre","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Comedy","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The fierce and funny five-star play returns to the big screen. Sam Mendes (The Lehman\r\nTrilogy) directs Mark Gatiss in an Olivier Award-winning performance as John Gielgud.\r\n1964: Richard Burton (Johnny Flynn), newly married to Elizabeth Taylor (Tuppence\r\nMiddleton), is set to play the title role in an experimental new Broadway production of Hamlet\r\nunder Gielgud’s exacting direction. But as rehearsals progress, two ages of theatre collide\r\nand the collaboration between actor and director soon threatens to unravel.\r\nFrom multi-award-winning writer Jack Thorne (Adolescence), this acclaimed production was\r\nfilmed live during its sold-out London run in 2023.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/d2a29388-7df4-4b23-9d7a-f968917e3a01.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"NT Live: The Motive and the Cue","instanceDates":"18 February-21 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/d2a29388-7df4-4b23-9d7a-f968917e3a01-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"267601ADCKHHHQBNTMNCDBDKJBJPPJMGJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-18T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-18T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-21T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-21T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Director":"Sam Mendes","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"517006","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2027","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Comedy Crackers is a perfectly-wrapped night of comedy taking place at Hertford BEAM for one night only, featuring household names Rich Hall, Mike Rice, Jack Skipper, and more!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5d2fa4d9-0ba2-4149-8014-847393e7ac09.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Off The Kerb Productions Presents: Comedy Crackers","instanceDates":"16 December-16 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5d2fa4d9-0ba2-4149-8014-847393e7ac09-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"235002ALBPNKVJVHMTPHGGLNNNKLKVMJR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-16T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-16T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-16T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-16T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"STRICTLY 14+","attribute_ContentWarning":"Likely to be swearing and adult content","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"THE SMASH-HIT IRISH MUSIC SHOW IS BACK! Join whiskey-loving fisherman Danny and his straight-talking wife Rosie for a night of laughter, music and mischief in this brand-new production of One Night In Dublin.  A band of award-winning musicians, including live fiddle and accordion, cover all of your favourite sing-along Irish classics including Galway Girl, Tell Me Ma, The Irish Rover, Dirty Old Town, Whiskey In The Jar, The Wild Rover, Galway Shawl and more.  Packed with heart, humour and classic hits, it’s like St. Patrick’s night every night – with extra craic and a whole lot of hooley! ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a78e0979-5edd-4171-aaf3-15b3a573f37d.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"One Night in Dublin","instanceDates":"24 June-24 June","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/a78e0979-5edd-4171-aaf3-15b3a573f37d-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"280401AGLBQGDSVTNGMSRPPTGLRSGCPVV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-24T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-24T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-24T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-24T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Two people with lots in common - a great sense of humour, a love of dance and they both have Parkinson's.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":115,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5863d47a-2684-433f-a85e-1febd06cc71a.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Onwards and Sideways","instanceDates":"13 November-19 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5863d47a-2684-433f-a85e-1febd06cc71a-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"280202AQRRGJBCVHGKLQDKSLQMLTNVMBS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-13T17:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-13T17:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-19T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-19T14:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"Contains strong language","attribute_Director":"John Madden","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"526508","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Comedy","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Drama","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The Ultimate Adult Panto is back for another outrageous UK tour\r\n–\r\nand this year it’s the turn of\r\nSnow White and the\r\nSeven Dwarfs\r\nto get the\r\nP*ssed Up Panto®\r\ntreatment!\r\nP*ssed Up Panto® has been causing hilarious havoc around the UK since 2021 with its riotous productions of\r\nAladdin\r\n,\r\nJack\r\nand the Beanstalk\r\n,\r\nSleeping Beauty\r\nand\r\nCinderella\r\n–\r\nand now the madness continues with a brand\r\n-\r\nnew show for 2027!\r\nSelling out theatres up and down the country,\r\nP*ssed Up Panto®\r\nhas perfected the ultimate adult panto formula, leaving\r\naudiences crying with laughter and theatres echoing with chaos night after night!\r\nBut what exactly is\r\nP*ssed Up Panto®\r\n? Well, if you’ve ever wondered what a pantomime cast might get up to if there\r\nwere no children in the audience... you’re already halfway there! Add to that a nail\r\n-\r\nbiting audience vote to decide which\r\nunlucky cast member must complete a savage drinking chall\r\nenge throughout the show (while the rest of the cast\r\ndesperately try to keep the story on track!) and you’ll quickly realise why absolutely anything could happen... and it\r\nprobably will!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/f04b697a-02d6-4f3f-93ca-988fd2037a8b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"P*ssed Up Panto: Snow White & the Seven Dwarfs","instanceDates":"1 April-1 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/f04b697a-02d6-4f3f-93ca-988fd2037a8b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"280201AKTVQJKJHTQRDNJPPJPVNLKCLPL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-01T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-01T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-01T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-01T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"16+ features strong language, adult themes and is not suitable for the easily offended.","attribute_ContentWarning":"16+ features strong language, adult themes and is not suitable for the easily offended.","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Pete Firman is back on tour with Jokus Pocus, a brand-new show packed with jaw-dropping magic, astonishing sleight of hand and laugh-out-loud comedy.\r\n\r\nWith over 10 million social media followers and more than a billion online views, Pete has established himself as one of the UK's most popular magicians. His TV appearances include Tonight at the London Palladium, The Next Great Magician, The John Bishop Show and Amazon's Good Omens. Strictly 11+ only!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0e5b3556-9544-4ec7-9c22-2bf72512e934.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Pete Firman: Jokus Pocus","instanceDates":"22 January-22 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0e5b3556-9544-4ec7-9c22-2bf72512e934-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"272401ASSJSQCTBDCBHGMHVMGBJLJHSPV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2028-01-22T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2028-01-22T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2028-01-22T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2028-01-22T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Strictly 11+ only!","attribute_ContentWarning":"Strictly 11+ only!","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNum