attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Olivier Award 2026 Winner!\r\n\r\nBack due to popular demand, following its remarkable simultaneous openings on Broadway and in the West End.  After its premiere in 2024, this powerful account of Jacob Dunne’s story sparked discussions everywhere, from theatres to courthouses and the House of Commons. Now it is back, with a brand new cast.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/bed5622f-ef4a-4e2c-b184-c8bf3033a12b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Punch","instanceDates":"23 March-27 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/bed5622f-ef4a-4e2c-b184-c8bf3033a12b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"217801ARPRSBNJLNRNSMNQRHBKLBMJJNK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-23T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-23T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-27T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-27T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"12 +","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Something Different – Fresh, original, or unexpected experience (ie new writing).","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Q The Music’s James Bond Concert Spectacular is the world’s finest and most critically acclaimed tribute to the music of James Bond.\r\nCelebrating more than 20 years as the first original and pioneering Bond concert, they are known for their stirring emotional and adrenaline-fueled performances, mixed in with superb musicianship and flair. Indeed, every fan club around the world recognises them as the best and finest performances of the songs since the originals.\r\n\r\nFocusing not only on theme songs, the show also pays homage to the complete canon covering chase music, incidental cues and suites from across the series.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":150,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0a722773-2953-4925-8509-ea92e62a5088.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Q The Music","instanceDates":"24 January-24 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0a722773-2953-4925-8509-ea92e62a5088-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"233601ABDRDGTVGMKJRVHNMQHKJNDRGGQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-24T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-24T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-24T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-24T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAnd