a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream?","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":170,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/c7aee1aa-90ca-4280-bf2c-314b0950896f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: Alice's Adventures in Wonderland (Ballet)","instanceDates":"28 March-28 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/c7aee1aa-90ca-4280-bf2c-314b0950896f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"226201ATTDQMMLCPGNGJDMTMPQCCVDNRH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-28T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-28T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-28T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-28T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500547","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Theatre","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Musical","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Spurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable. Sung in Italian with English subtitles.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":210,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/7cf019c8-c034-4e2d-bdfc-3f8a615e0aeb.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: Così fan Tutte (Opera)","instanceDates":"28 February-28 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/7cf019c8-c034-4e2d-bdfc-3f8a615e0aeb-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"226001ABHPCRLMMGDVDGPBCSDDHMQPBLM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-28T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-28T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-28T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-28T14:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500519","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Music","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Deception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Brünnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved’s innocence, Brünnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. For the long-awaited finale of Wagner’s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary\r\nworld of dream-like turmoil. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":350,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/bf84f457-1509-4b26-bc1e-a16626134b34.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: Götterdämmerung (Opera)","instanceDates":"7 February-7 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/bf84f457-1509-4b26-bc1e-a16626134b34-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"225801APRKKJLBTPVNRCMHQTKTDJKDDRS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-07T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-07T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-07T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-07T14:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500518","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Edge of Your Seat – Thrilling, intense, suspenseful.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Music","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Shakespeare’s timeless tale of star-crossed lovers is transformed in Kenneth MacMillan’s mesmerising ballet. The flourishing of young love is just as present in Romeo and Juliet's meeting on the balcony as in their final moments when they desperately cling to life in the tomb. Prokofiev’s evocative music sets the scene for stolen romantic moments and deadly feuds and sweeps the ballet\r\ntowards its inevitable and tragic conclusion.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":170,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/89d4dfb9-2945-4fb3-a7c5-e561c08cfef1.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: Romeo & Juliet (Ballet)","instanceDates":"30 May-30 May","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/89d4dfb9-2945-4fb3-a7c5-e561c08cfef1-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"226402ADPNHHRKLCTHRCRRHRHDNSTTRMB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-30T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-30T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-30T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-30T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500522","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Date Night – Ideal for couples looking for a special evening.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Theatre","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Musical","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Princess Odette is bound by a curse, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and pledges to free her. But freedom is not promised for Odette as Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers’ plans.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":205,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/28a9663b-a6a2-49a4-815a-e5ed3007ee8d.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: Swan Lake (Ballet)","instanceDates":"25 April-25 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/28a9663b-a6a2-49a4-815a-e5ed3007ee8d-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"226401AJBBKJBTKNVGHBLQJCHMDVPKHHR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-25T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-25T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-25T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-25T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500520","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Date Night – Ideal for couples looking for a special evening.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Theatre","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Musical","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/90236101-3059-4987-80bf-3d6f26725a44.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: The Nutcracker (Ballet)","instanceDates":"13 December-13 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/90236101-3059-4987-80bf-3d6f26725a44-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"225601AMHSDBTMRDMQBLHMHCSRBVBNJQD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-13T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-13T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-13T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-13T14:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500517","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Theatre","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Musical","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":195,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/8d87b8b5-697a-4c38-bd2a-98ed2c82f2d5.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"RBO: Tosca (Opera)","instanceDates":"9 May-9 May","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/8d87b8b5-697a-4c38-bd2a-98ed2c82f2d5-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"225402ATLSDVJMBSRPHRGVRMJJKJJNQCR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-09T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-09T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-09T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-09T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Suitable for ages 14+","attribute_ContentWarning":"This screening contains depictions of executions, violence, blood, gore, murder, sexual assault, implied torture and suicide.","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500521","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Edge of Your Seat – Thrilling, intense, suspenseful.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Music","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Funny Bones is Rob’s brand-new stand-up show: a relentlessly funny and daft evening of comedy, from a one-man whirlwind who pulls the audience into his craftily spun tall tales with bucketfuls of manic energy, first-class stagecraft, eerily relatable characters, and a barrage of brilliant one-liners.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/6a707324-a888-49dd-bde4-c82c8fe1ea1b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Rob Rouse: Funny Bones","instanceDates":"14 January-14 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/6a707324-a888-49dd-bde4-c82c8fe1ea1b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"224401ATKNLTSQSCBKNQKGLKRDJHTQMCH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-14T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-14T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-14T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-14T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"16+ ","attribute_ContentWarning":"Some strong language and adult themes","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"In his most intimate tour to date, Russell takes you on a journey through the highs and lows of an extraordinary life – from chart-topping success to surviving not one, but two life-threatening illnesses. With warmth, humour, and a voice that soars, he’ll share the personal stories behind the spotlight.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":165,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/49bc66bf-8254-4db4-9840-ffea63db5449.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Russell Watson: An Intimate Evening With ‘The Voice’","instanceDates":"16 November-16 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/49bc66bf-8254-4db4-9840-ffea63db5449-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"155601AQQJMMDSMDCHDMMNRQRTNRLNJHN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-16T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-16T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-16T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-16T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Celebrity Talk","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The Year 6 Owls and Eagles classes at Simon Balle All-through School are excited to present William Shakespeare’s Macbeth. Over the coming weeks, pupils will demonstrate responsibility and dedication as they learn their lines, rehearse scenes, and bring this timeless tragedy to life. Their hard work will culminate in the thrilling opportunity to perform in a real theatre, sharing their talents and creativity with a live audience.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Dear Families and Friends of Year 6,<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We are delighted to invite you to join us for our Year 6 performance of Macbeth, taking place on stage at the BEAM Theatre. Our students have shown remarkable dedication and enthusiasm in studying Shakespeare’s language and bringing this classic story to life.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We hope you will enjoy their performance as much as they have enjoyed preparing it.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Warm regards,<span><br/></span>Year 6 Team<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>________________<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><table class=\" BorderOn\">\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Running Time</span> </td><td align=\"left\">1hr 40 including 20 minute interval<span><br/></span></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table><span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Simon Balle Macbeth Y6 26","instanceDates":"17 November-17 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"159001ACDLPGTDKCCLJGDLMHSDRMQVGKV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-17T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-17T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-17T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-17T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Community Vibe – Local connection, social events.","attribute_FinanceFilter":"Hire","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":true,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Local Talent","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Simon Fowler will relive his best work during an evening of classic songs and stories. He’ll also trace the origins of that work, taking fans on a compelling journey back to his pre-OCS days. Expect new songs and classic hits, fantastic tales and amusing anecdotes from one of Britpop’s central characters.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/4827b195-7378-4e43-afa9-98ea326b5d24.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Simon Fowler: The Ocean Colour Scene Songbook... and beyond","instanceDates":"15 April-15 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/4827b195-7378-4e43-afa9-98ea326b5d24-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"222401AQTGRHKSCJHQSLNPGSMBBLCSTDV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-15T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-15T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-15T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-15T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"a photograph, autograph and goody bag","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"6pm","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"Yes","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Celebrity Talk","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Stage Right Centre for the Performing Arts presents Showtime 2027!\r\nJoin our talented students from the ages of 3 years through to adults as they dance and sing their way through a jam packed production. Showcasing an array of dance styles from ballet and tap to jazz and commercial this show will not disappoint.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":150,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/e4bf1ee0-f16c-4b30-9666-2a9b5cea44b0.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Stage Right presents Showtime 2027","instanceDates":"21 March-21 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/e4bf1ee0-f16c-4b30-9666-2a9b5cea44b0-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"278001AVQBLRCTQCTDPTVLRHKQHJLPTRH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-21T12:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-21T12:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-21T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-21T17:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Dance","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The newest wave of rising comedians from BEAM Masterclass: Stand Up Comedy Course with Alistair Barrie are hitting the stage to share their work with the public for the very first time. After weeks of developing their material under the guidance of acclaimed comedian Alistair Barrie, these performers are ready to showcase their unique voices, bold ideas, and brand-new sets.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/ff8da3c4-18f5-4410-95cb-0276aead729b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Stand-up Comedy Course Showcase with Alistair Barrie","instanceDates":"27 October-24 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/ff8da3c4-18f5-4410-95cb-0276aead729b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"163001ARQRTQGRQTPRSLQMCBJVRCCJJVK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-27T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-27T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-24T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-24T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"18+","attribute_ContentWarning":"Contains strong language and mature themes","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_FinanceFilter":"Self Produced","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The only American tribute show celebrating the music of the Four Tops and other legendary Motown artists touring the UK.\r\n\r\nPaying homage to the legends, vocal group Soul Satisfaction brings the Motown magic back to the stage in a live concert with powerful vocals, splendid harmonies and high stepping dance routines. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b0ab9560-053e-4c4b-b433-573b4e18e708.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">THE ONLY AMERICAN TRIBUTE SHOW CELEBRATING THE MUSIC OF THE FOUR TOPS AND OTHER LEGENDARY MOTOWN ARTISTS TOURING THE UK.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Paying homage to the legends, vocal group Soul Satisfaction brings the Motown magic back to the stage in a live concert with powerful vocals, splendid harmonies and high stepping dance routines. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>You will be taken on a journey through all the hits of the Four Tops, Reach Out, Baby I Need Your Loving, Walk Away Renee, Same Old Song, Loco in Acapulco, Standing In the Shadow, Bernadette along with other classic hits from the golden era including songs from the Temptations, Smokey Robinson and the Miracles, Marvin Gaye, Ben E King and many more Motown and soul legends.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>One of Motown’s most legendary songwriters Eddie Holland, from the Holland-Dozier-Holland team, responsible for all of the Four Tops greatest hits as well as other Motown classics, said <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>DISCLAIMER: <span class=\"ItalicText\">This show is a tribute, concept style show and not affiliated or endorsed by any original artistes</span> estates<span class=\"ItalicText\"> management. Promoter reserves the right to alter the programme at any given time.</span> \r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b0ab9560-053e-4c4b-b433-573b4e18e708.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Sugar Pie Honey Bunch","instanceDates":"7 March-7 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b0ab9560-053e-4c4b-b433-573b4e18e708-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"97601ANGGDVGHNHNKSKTVRHMBMCQRLHVB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-07T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-07T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-07T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-07T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Now undoubtedly one of the most established and successful Tribute Bands in the world, The SUPREME QUEEN Production is a brilliantly designed presentation paying homage to the halcyon days of one of the greatest rock bands ever. Musically exceptional throughout, the production brings together some of the finest and most recognisable Queen tribute performers in the world.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b2a26deb-a98c-46da-869c-e40af24b30a7.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Supreme Queen","instanceDates":"26 February-26 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b2a26deb-a98c-46da-869c-e40af24b30a7-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"235201ARLRLLJDSNKKSVSGHGBRJGKCKDT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-26T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-26T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-26T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-26T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"After thrilling audiences across five continents with over 900 shows, Tap Factory is back in the UK, now in its Reloaded version: bigger, bolder, and more spectacular than ever! Feel the pulse of explosive percussion, experience new generation tap, marvel at breathtaking acrobatics, and laugh out loud as live music collides with electrifying performance. Fast, furious, and funnier than ever, Tap Factory is a dazzling spectacle for the whole family!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/4d5d117a-af20-43c6-8afc-c98fcdc6b698.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Tap Factory","instanceDates":"27 February-27 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/4d5d117a-af20-43c6-8afc-c98fcdc6b698-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"243401APPBCKSKLSGLBGDGPCBQDBHVRGB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-27T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-27T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-27T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-27T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Family","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Celebrate the festive season in style with the internationally acclaimed BBC Big Band, legendary conductor Barry Forgie, and the extraordinary vocal talents of vocalist Emer McParland, as they perform a sparkling collection of seasonal favourites.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/f6d3630f-385d-466f-a4bd-a3f9d4c30212.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Conductor - Barry Forgie<span><br/></span>Vocalist - Emer McParland<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Celebrate the festive season in style with the internationally acclaimed BBC Big Band, legendary conductor Barry Forgie, and the extraordinary vocal talents of vocalist Emer McParland, as they perform a sparkling collection of seasonal favourites.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Expect an evening of festive classics - with a Swing twist! Featuring numbers such as Winter Wonderland, Santa Baby, I’ve Got My Love to Keep Me Warm, and The Christmas Song - through to reimagined versions of classic Christmas carols and a sprinkling of Big Band classics.   This is the perfect swinging start to your Christmas celebrations!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>World class … a brilliant musical force<span><br/></span>The Telegraph<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Joyous...!<span><br/></span>George Benson<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">About the Artists:</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The BBC Big Band:<span><br/></span>Widely regarded as one of the world’s leading and most versatile Orchestras, The BBC Big Band continues to delight audiences around the world through their broadcasts on BBC Radio and their live performances.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In addition to its regular studio and concert recordings, the BBC Big Band regularly gives live performances at major venues around the UK, as well as touring with major music artists abroad. Within the UK, the BBC Big Band is perhaps best known for its show Big Band Special on BBC Radio 2, as well its appearances on BBC Radio 3’s Jazz Line Up. Its performances also reach huge global audiences through its regular broadcasts for the BBC World Service, satellite radio and via the internet.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Emer McParland (vocals):</span><span><br/></span>Trained at Trinity College of Music in London, Emer’s unique versatility has led her to be involved in various music projects. These have included singing on movie soundtracks such as Avengers, Disney’s Aladdin, Harry Potter, Mission: Impossible, Tomb Raider, Sleepy Hollow and The Mummy Returns, as well as being featured along include popular music artists such as diverse as Peter Gabriel, Katherine Jenkins and Bjork.<span><br/></span>Emer's heart lies in live work, and she has appeared at some of the UK’s premier music venues, including The Royal Albert Hall, London’s legendary jazz venue Ronnie Scott's, as well as London’s Hyde Park.  Her orchestral experience includes appearances with the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Hallé Orchestra,  RTE Concert Orchestra (Ireland), The BBC Concert Orchestra and, of course, the wonderful BBC Big Band<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Barry Forgie (musical director & conductor):</span><span><br/></span>When you consider that Barry Forgie conducted a brass band at three, was playing trombone at ten, and leading his own jazz group at 16, it seems strange that his first career aspiration was to be a vet! However, the lure of music eventually led him to a Bachelor of Music Degree at the University of Wales, and regular BBC broadcasts with his own band.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Over the course of his career Barry has worked as an arranger/composer and musical associate on numerous Hollywood films, Concert Tours, and BBC Recordings and Broadcasts. He has covered the whole gamut of music, from conducting Andrew Lloyd Webber's Song And Dance in London's West End to the composition of a 50-minute Beatles symphony.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Barry began conducting the BBC Big Band on a regular basis in 1977. He has built an unparalleled repertoire for the band, transcribing the best of big band music from early Ellington, through the Swing era, to the likes of Gerry Mulligan and Buddy Rich. Unrealised ambitions to swim the Channel, play rugby for England, row for Cambridge, defeat Kasparov at chess, and invent a new computer language for Microsoft, are more than compensated for by the thrill of fronting the BBC Big Band!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/f6d3630f-385d-466f-a4bd-a3f9d4c30212.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The BBC Big Band, “A Swinging Christmas”","instanceDates":"20 November-20 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/f6d3630f-385d-466f-a4bd-a3f9d4c30212-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":"BBCBIGBAND","id":"115401ARNVTRQNCBBQVNMJMMLPGDNJPLG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-20T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-20T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-20T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-20T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Date Night – Ideal for couples looking for a special evening.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"With nearly 40 years’ experience in the business and as the premier name in comedy, The Comedy Store is renowned as a breeding ground for new comedy talent, and remains the place to see tomorrow’s stars today. The likes of Eddie Izzard, John Bishop, Jimmy Carr, Rhod Gilbert and Sarah Millican, have all cut their comedy teeth with us.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Comedy Store 2027","instanceDates":"19 February-5 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"204601AVHTSCSDNTGDBQMSPQJKBVVRTQM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-19T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-19T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-11-05T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-11-05T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"18+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The Dazzling Diamonds are back with a bigger, bolder and funnier show than ever before! Following West End success and sold-out theatres nationwide, the hilarious trio return with a brand-new comedy drag spectacular packed with outrageous comedy, sensational live vocals and jaw-dropping dance routines. Featuring iconic hits from Dolly Parton, Adele, Kylie and Abba, this fast-paced, laugh-out-loud show is guaranteed to leave audiences crying with laughter.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":135,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/81305124-9756-4ea7-988a-895d2798ab82.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Dazzling Diamonds","instanceDates":"17 June-17 June","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/81305124-9756-4ea7-988a-895d2798ab82-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"224201AQTNCDJKLNGVTBSBPVCSTGNNSSG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-17T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-17T18:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-17T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-17T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"16+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Musical","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The Drifters are back on tour in the UK performing all their classic hits including ‘Saturday Night at the Movies', ‘You’re More Than A Number,’ 'In\r\nMy Little Red Book' ‘Come on Over to My Place’, ‘Under the Boardwalk’, ‘ Save The Last Dance For Me’ and many, many more!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/31d6eb51-d960-4e81-971a-6e62979b8173.jpg\" /><span><br/></span>The Drifters are back on tour in the UK, performing all their classic hits, including Saturday Night at the Movies, You’re More Than A Number, Come on Over to My Place, Under the Boardwalk, Kissin’ In The Back Row, and many more!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The legendary group has been inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame, performed for the President of the United States, and been listed among the Greatest Artists of All Time by Rolling Stone magazine.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Under the guidance of Tina Treadwell (daughter of the group’s original founders, George & Faye Treadwell), The Drifters have enjoyed a remarkable resurgence in recent years with multiple successful UK tours, including headline shows in major arenas and, most notably, their first-ever appearance at the world-famous Royal Albert Hall in London.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“I am thrilled with the success of our recent UK tours, and we invite you all to join us in continuing to celebrate this incredible and everlasting story of The Drifters,” said Tina, speaking about the tour.<span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/31d6eb51-d960-4e81-971a-6e62979b8173.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Drifters","instanceDates":"10 April-10 April","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/31d6eb51-d960-4e81-971a-6e62979b8173-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":"drift26","id":"46401AJJTJHQJSQQVGTKDVGHPLJJBLHMJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-10T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-10T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-04-10T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-04-10T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"Special Effects : Haze, flashing light no strobe.","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Musical","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"\"the perfect mums' night out\" vision theatre \r\n\"I laughed so much I fell off my chair\" gemma, essex \r\n\r\nMums’ Night Out Comedy is the ultimate night out for mums. A hilarious and feel-good night of relatable comedy where you can properly switch off and have a  laugh with your mum mates. \r\nHosted by comedian and content creator The Funny Mummy (25M+ social media views, “Hilarious!” — Netmums), the show features top stand-up comedians from across the UK comedy circuit alongside games, music, prizes and more. \r\n Previous acts include Rachel Paris (Mock the Week), Esther Manito (Live at the Apollo), Tiffany Stevenson (Mock the Week) and more.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/67dc1671-db5f-481d-a505-99c1b69214de.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Funny Mummy: Mums' Night Out Comedy","instanceDates":"6 March-6 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/67dc1671-db5f-481d-a505-99c1b69214de-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"268801APHNSVLNSHTBNDLJMJVNSGLQKRS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-06T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-06T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-06T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-06T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"18+ Only","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/6534d96d-b8f5-4a5e-9f8b-16238f1b58fe.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Horne Section: Six Absolute Helmets (Tour Preview)","instanceDates":"27 January-27 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/6534d96d-b8f5-4a5e-9f8b-16238f1b58fe-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"271801AMPRTMNVVNPDKSCDKLHVKDJNDLL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-27T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-27T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-27T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-27T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"12+ but up to parental/guardian discretion","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Set 24 years before the events of the first film, a young Haymitch Abernathy is selected to compete in the 50th Hunger Games.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":158,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/174b4afe-76bc-4a1f-93e7-ae3760376438.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Hunger Games: Sunrise On The Reaping","instanceDates":"20 November-26 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/174b4afe-76bc-4a1f-93e7-ae3760376438-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"277401APPKJBLKRMSVCSBRQTJCJRNJCCC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-20T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-20T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-26T20:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-26T20:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Accessible":"Audio Description & Caption Available","attribute_ContentWarning":"This film contains moderate violence, injury detail, threat, upsetting scenes","attribute_Director":"Francis Lawrence","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"421975","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Edge of Your Seat – Thrilling, intense, suspenseful.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Action","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Adventure","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"12A","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The Illegal Eagles return in 2027 with their brand new ‘Their Greatest Hits’ Tour. Experience the legendary Eagles album Their Greatest Hits (1971–1975) performed in full, featuring classics like Take It Easy, Lyin’ Eyes and Desperado. The evening also includes favourites from across the Eagles’ remarkable catalogue in an unforgettable live music experience.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":145,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/fe30b2cf-cb5a-4e23-8cb8-7122ddd0af73.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Illegal Eagles – Their Greatest Hits Tour 2027","instanceDates":"14 March-14 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/fe30b2cf-cb5a-4e23-8cb8-7122ddd0af73-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"256801ARCJKKKNKTMTNRJLLTTJMMBPCPG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-14T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-14T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-14T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-14T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"Under 16’s to be accompanied by an adult","attribute_ContentWarning":"Water-based Haze effects are used","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Join \"everyone's favourite pantomime dame!\" (Metro) and Britain's Got Talent semi-finalist Mama G on an award winning, panto adventure for the whole family.\r\n\r\nBook Worm is livid that encyclopaedias give people so much knowledge, so decides to steal all the books from Mama G's library. Before the world can turn to chaos, Mama G vows to save the day by proving that books can help make the world a better place. Of course, she can't do it alone, and that's when she discovers the mysterious and wonderful Magic Bookmark...\r\n\r\nFamilies will love this storytelling show full of panto fun, original songs, and some of the finest picture books on the market!\r\n\r\nThe show has toured all over the UK and recently made its Off-Broadway debut at the SoHo Playhouse in New York.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0eb4be7b-18b5-4931-a14a-8b606c5c191e.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Magic Bookmark","instanceDates":"27 February-27 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/0eb4be7b-18b5-4931-a14a-8b606c5c191e-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"269001ADSPHKPRHCVGCHMQVRKNCTQQPDJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-27T11:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-27T11:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-27T11:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-27T11:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":" 5+ (Guideline)","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Family","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Dare to believe in magic as the UK's #1 magic show returns with a completely new and uplifting production for 2025. You're invited to a night of wonder, as secrets unravel and the impossible becomes possible. Following an unprecedented 5 years of sold-out shows around the world - this five star magic show guarantees to leave you aching with laughter & dizzy in disbelief.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<span><br/></span>Presented by world-renowned award winning magician James Phelan, the first magician in history to sell out a solo-run at The Magic Circle - and most infamous for jamming the BBC switchboard after he correctly predicted the lottery.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Don't miss what The Standard calls \"An unforgettable evening we can't stop talking about\".<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>‘Joel Dommett meets David Blaine’ (The Sun)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>‘Barely skips a beat. One to watch in the world of magic’ (The List)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>★★★★★ ‘Magic is in his bones. Disbelief. Flabbergasted. Stunned’ (Henley Herald)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>★★★★★ ‘This isn’t a show for people who want to see magic on stage. This is for people who want to feel it’ (World Magic Review)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>★★★★★ ‘One of the most endearing factors is seeing amazed faces young and old. This show has many moments like that’ (BBC Sounds)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All new material for 2025. Tickets limited and will sell out quickly.\r\n</div>","duration":145,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5c95a5dd-e9a0-4259-82a2-37329eb15ee8.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Man Who Was Magic","instanceDates":"5 June-5 June","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5c95a5dd-e9a0-4259-82a2-37329eb15ee8-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"179001AHMHLVDRHJDLMNNLCQJJHJJCLJH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-05T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-05T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-06-05T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-06-05T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"12+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Funny stuff, made up on the spot. No gimmicks, no tricks - just the quickest, wittiest improvisers in the UK putting on a show to make you laugh like nobody’s business. Don't miss your chance to see the award-winning, twelve-time sell-out legends of the Edinburgh Fringe Festival.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/e257d97c-d45d-4d57-8fa3-851d80b85192.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Noise Next Door","instanceDates":"29 January-29 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/e257d97c-d45d-4d57-8fa3-851d80b85192-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"252401AQLGRLGSNLLKNTVJBMVJVPMRMKD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-29T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-29T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-29T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-29T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"15+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Comedy","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The SEARCHERS Experience comes to BEAM! 60s music fans, get ready for a night of million-selling hits: Don’t Throw Your Love Away, When You Walk in the Room, Needles and Pins, Sweets for My Sweet, Love Potion No9, Sugar and Spice. All performed live in concert. Lead vocalist of The Searchers for an incredible 37 years, Spencer James, will take you back to the 60s in a night you won’t forget, as The Searchers incredible music legacy lives on. Book your seats now.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":140,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/db6f90c8-ca77-4e61-9a53-0f4e3f4867e2.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Searchers Experience","instanceDates":"23 January-23 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/db6f90c8-ca77-4e61-9a53-0f4e3f4867e2-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"260001ANVLDHBVRKNBHJHHTRRCCPCRDNG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-23T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-23T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-23T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-23T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Using huge projection photos and original film footage, the international hit show tells the story of the origins and meteoric rise of Simon & Garfunkel. Blended together seamlessly with a full live band performing all the hits including Mrs Robinson, Cecilia, Bridge Over Troubled Water, Homeward Bound and many more.  ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/259e28f6-1861-44fe-9019-8f816641df5b.jpg\" /><span><br/></span>Few shows have experienced the phenomenal global success of The Simon & Garfunkel Story, with multiple sold-out shows in over 50-countries worldwide and over 20 headline performances in London’s West End, including multiple appearances at the world-famous London Palladium.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Using huge projection photos and original film footage, the international hit show tells the story of the origins and meteoric rise of Simon & Garfunkel blended together seamlessly with a full live band performing all the hits including Mrs Robinson, Cecilia, Bridge Over Troubled Water, Homeward Bound and many more.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With standing ovations at every performance at the show Art Garfunkel himself loved, you don’t want to miss this international sensation.\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/259e28f6-1861-44fe-9019-8f816641df5b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Simon & Garfunkel Story","instanceDates":"10 January-10 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/259e28f6-1861-44fe-9019-8f816641df5b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"130801APPNPBCNHKVLRRCJDGTVHDCNBKC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-10T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-10T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-10T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-10T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Date Night – Ideal for couples looking for a special evening.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Join Lead Curator of the Bayeux Tapestry exhibition at the British Museum, Michael Lewis, and historian David Musgrove for the definitive guide to the Bayeux Tapestry and the extraordinary narrative behind its stitches.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/61668f61-2c70-4afd-8cef-4366210bc06e.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Story of the Bayeux Tapestry: Unravelling the Norman Conquest","instanceDates":"23 February-23 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/61668f61-2c70-4afd-8cef-4366210bc06e-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"276001AKPTDBVCBKPVQPLMJPJMQDGNGPP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-23T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-23T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-23T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-23T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"14+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Celebrity Talk","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Theatre","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The West End Tenors Leading men from London’s West End combine in a powerhouse of vocal talent. After selling out arenas across Europe, The West End Tenors embark on their first UK Tour, bringing their smash hit show directly to you!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/3ecdf452-6257-483a-ba05-454942d484c3.jpg\" /><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The West End Tenors Leading men from London’s West End combine in a powerhouse of vocal talent. After selling out arenas across Europe, The West End Tenors embark on their first UK Tour, bringing their smash hit show directly to you! The cast of The West End Tenors have starred in musicals such as Les Misérables, The Phantom of the Opera, Mamma Mia and Miss Saigon, as well as performing at Windsor Castle for the Royal Family, the BBC Proms and the Eurovision Song Contest. Celebrating the greatest triumphs of Musical Theatre & Film, their spine-tingling vocals are not to be missed, leaving audiences breathless from start to finish.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>________________<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/3ecdf452-6257-483a-ba05-454942d484c3.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The West End Tenors","instanceDates":"3 March-3 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/3ecdf452-6257-483a-ba05-454942d484c3-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"83802AKSLTRKDVHPPHKCGMTDSNTRSCTKC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-03T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-03T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-03T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-03T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Big Night Out – High-impact, social occasion, visually impressive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"Musical","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"DOUBLE BILL: TWAWSI – THE WORLD AS WE SEE IT… \r\n \r\nHuman life is fleeting, the world is still unfolding…\r\n \r\nRedefining dance from the African Diaspora, ACE dance and music’s new double bill presents two powerful contrasting visions of our world today.\r\n \r\n‘ECHOES OF DUST’ – choreographed by Serge Aimé Coulibaly, with creative contributions Sigué Sayouba\r\n \r\nWhen the world trembles, what remains of our humanity?\r\n \r\nWhen all seems lost, what hope can we still hold on to?\r\n \r\nIn a world torn apart by war, disaster and the invisible collapse of human connection; seven individuals find themselves stranded in the heart of chaos. Confronting the remnants of a shattered world, stripped of certainty and memory they stumble, fight, and protest; with each encounter, a voice is reclaimed. \r\n \r\n ‘LETLALO’ – choreographed by Vincent Mantsoe \r\n \r\nLetlalo, meaning \"Skin\" in Mantsoe’s native tongue ‘Sotho’, draws from African, Indigenous, and contemporary dance languages to explore the deep connection between humanity and the earth. \r\n \r\nRooted in ancestral wisdom and inspired by nomadic cultures, the performance reflects on the quiet strength of communities living in harmony. It examines the layers beneath the surface, exploring the true essence of the human spirit, while evoking themes of power, unity, serenity, and interconnectedness.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":80,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/290b1680-b377-4181-ab4a-ddc202e6581b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The World As We See It","instanceDates":"10 February-10 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/290b1680-b377-4181-ab4a-ddc202e6581b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"268601ASVQMRRBGTRNHMCPVPPMRCNBTKN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-10T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-10T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-10T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-10T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"7yrs+","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Dance","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Two friends looking to escape their humdrum lives suddenly find themselves on the run from the law in this 1991 thriller. There are stark and distressing moments, but the themes of friendship and empowerment prevail.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5c014d14-669f-4998-a230-22029b302562.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Thelma & Louise","instanceDates":"13 February-13 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/5c014d14-669f-4998-a230-22029b302562-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"264001AVDDHPNMHQSMLQPSRQLHJKHNMRB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-13T17:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-13T17:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-13T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-13T17:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"Contains strong violence, sex, language, sexual assault","attribute_Director":"Ridley Scott","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"209766","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Crime","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Drama","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Seasonal","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"1991","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"A thrilling big-screen experience for fans of classic British sci-fi, this Thunderbirds double bill brings together two of the most iconic episodes ever made: Atlantic Inferno and Attack of the Alligrators. Bursting with action, suspense, and Gerry Anderson’s groundbreaking Supermarionation, these fan favourites showcase International Rescue at its very best— combining daring rescues, stunning model work, unforgettable characters and giant alligators!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":102,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b8ed1098-1623-4bd7-b85f-ef0188bc8e2b.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Thunderbirds 4K Restoration Double Bill Atlantic Inferno and Attack of the Alligators!","instanceDates":"5 December-5 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/b8ed1098-1623-4bd7-b85f-ef0188bc8e2b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"273202AMHLVMCTRMSNQRGNBSLTPBCMCMB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-05T16:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-05T16:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-05T16:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-05T16:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Director":"Desmond Saunders, David Lane","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"479845","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Romantic Comedy","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":true,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_MustSeeEvent":"Yes","attribute_Rating":"U","attribute_ScreenStrands":"Event Cinema","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"It’s Tim Vine with a barrage of new drivel.  Expect daft jokes aplenty, lots of  stupid props and a sprinkling of musical interloons. Stand by and strap in!  \r\nThe management kindly reminds you to breathe normally between jokes to avoid suffocation. “A joyous explosion” The Times.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/50befb44-9582-4cd3-9437-7261e81d02a7.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Tim Vine: Sillypun Valley","instanceDates":"30 September-1 October","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/50befb44-9582-4cd3-9437-7261e81d02a7-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"275801ARMNRBMPMPDDLJDCTGNGMJJKLJB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-09-30T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-09-30T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-10-01T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-10-01T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_StageGenre":