asonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Ward Thomas are an English modern country-pop duo, composed of twin sisters Catherine and Lizzy Ward Thomas from Hampshire. The band has been called \"Britain's first country stars\". They will be joined by special guest Elles Bailey!\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":150,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/9399c88f-3909-4c2f-ae0f-1427129da364.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ward Thomas","instanceDates":"2 May-2 May","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/9399c88f-3909-4c2f-ae0f-1427129da364-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"257001ALJHVCGKJCNBJQHJBLCTCJDNCBR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-02T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-02T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-02T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-02T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Feel-Good Escape – Comforting, uplifting entertainment.","attribute_IncludeInterval":true,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Music","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"An ostracised fisherwoman commissions the local basketmaker to weave her a husband, but when her wicker creation proves unexpectedly extraordinary, his presence ignites jealousy and upheaval that threatens their quiet village.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":105,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/dca1217f-5c02-4fd1-8ef0-7f60426314e2.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Wicker","instanceDates":"30 October-19 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/dca1217f-5c02-4fd1-8ef0-7f60426314e2-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"265202AVSDPCQSRHHKGPLTKLMDTKSNLLP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-30T17:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-30T17:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-19T17:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-19T17:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Director":"Alex Huston Fischer and Eleanor Wilson","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"476460","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Drama","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Fantasy","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"TBC","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"The live comedy game show where you play along! Log in with your smartphone/tablet and compete in games, puzzles and quizzes to win the show! Hosted by comedian Steve McNeil (team captain, \"Dara O’Briain’s Go 8 Bit\"). Different games/quizzes at each - come to both!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\t<img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/db076c89-1efb-4c68-96e1-87aaa25605a1.jpg\" /><span><br/></span>From classic TV game shows to zen-like word puzzles, from retro video games to modern first person shooters, WiFi Wars has something for everyone in its truly original whistlestop tour of all the ways you can have fun, in public.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The entire audience competes, both as teams and as individuals, on games, quizzes and more that are magically beamed into their smartphones and tablets using WiFi Wars’ Guinness World Record -Breaking tech, developed in residency at London’s prestigious Royal Institution.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Hosted by comedian Steve McNeil (team captain on the hit TV show \"Dara O’Briain’s Go 8 Bit\"), WiFi Wars is the Award -Winning must -see show that’s like nothing you’ve seen before. As teams and players thrive and fail, each show’s unique narrative emerges hilariously in real time, with freshly-minted heroes becoming local legends in every place they visit.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">DISCLAIMER: ENSURE YOU BRING A SMART DEVICE </span> (phone or tablet) FOR EACH PLAYER - essentially you just need something with a touch-screen and a web-browser installed. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Also, make sure it’s got some battery charge in it as you’ll use it to play along with the entire show, but don’t worry - it doesn’t hugely drain your battery. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>And you don’t need to download an app or install anything in advance, we’ll get you all set up when you arrive.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">There’ll be different games and quizzes at each show, so feel free to do what many others have done in the past, and come to both.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Recommended for ages 6+ (matinee), 12+ (evening)\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/db076c89-1efb-4c68-96e1-87aaa25605a1.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Wifi Wars","instanceDates":"30 May-30 May","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/db076c89-1efb-4c68-96e1-87aaa25605a1-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"128801AMGHJTTHPDLLPSDCNLTCJPRMHPT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-30T15:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-30T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-30T15:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-30T14:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"6+ (matinee), 12+ (evening)","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Stage","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Family Day Out – Great for all ages, relaxed and inclusive.","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_StageGenre":"Family","attribute_Rating":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_SendToDCM":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_ScreenStrands":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_YearOfRelease":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee travel to Easter Island. There, they meet two female vacationing students who actively support President Allende's regime.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":118,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/216d1e62-b29e-48b8-bcf9-dfa46c513c2c.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Wild Horse Nine","instanceDates":"6 November-19 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/216d1e62-b29e-48b8-bcf9-dfa46c513c2c-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"267801ANKPCRLHQDNVGRKJCGVDRTBHJLL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-06T14:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-06T14:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-19T20:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-19T20:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Accessible":"Audio Description & Caption Available","attribute_ContentWarning":"This film contains very strong language, strong violence, drug misuse","attribute_Director":"Martin McDonagh","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"498143","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Laughs Guaranteed – Lighthearted, fun vibe.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Comedy","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Drama","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"Yes","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""},{"description":"Thirty-four days before she's sent to prison, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon soon becomes a mind-bending, three-year journey into the abyss.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":174,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/3cd56f20-0b4b-462f-abf1-34ab33c60361.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"You Can See Everything","instanceDates":"20 November-26 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/beamhertford/files/3cd56f20-0b4b-462f-abf1-34ab33c60361-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"276602AJBGQRKMKCCJVPRVPPKVVKQNCVN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-20T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-20T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-26T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-26T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Director":"Nathan Fielder, Lance Oppenheim","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"527793","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"997653","attribute_EventType":"Screen","attribute_ExperienceDescriptors":"Thought-Provoking – Stimulates conversation and reflection.","attribute_FilmGenrePRIMARY":"Documentary","attribute_FilmGenreSECONDARY":"Crime","attribute_IncludeInterval":false,"attribute_KioskPromoted":false,"attribute_KioskUnavailable":false,"attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_ScreenStrands":"New Release","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_YearOfRelease":"2026","attribute_AgeRecommendation":"","attribute_WebsiteGenreSeasonal":"","attribute_StageGenre":"","attribute_Accessible":"","attribute_MustSeeEvent":"","attribute_ContentWarning":"","attribute_FinanceFilter":"","attribute_StageGenreSECONDARY":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetTickets":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetStartTime":"","attribute_MeetAndGreetIncludes":"","attribute_Language":""}]